    "localization": {
      "en": {
        "00f4d6c0be366bfe684ba29c": "So, did the smugglers pull off the commander's rescue?",
        "60fe158c6da93b653b15a977": "Yeah. Didn't go clean, they took losses. But they got their commander out.",
        "4c38c7f9c1959adc297266fe": "So now they've got time to help me?",
        "90318986e439526e74fd0e79": "Honestly, I didn't even think the smugglers stood a chance against the Rogues.",
        "e3f85d6111df366a44496f62": "Can't promise anything. You chose to get involved in all this. But I'm heading over there anyway, I'll ask about your situation too.",
        "aa8e7bcf69f70c30c6de7b15": "Anything I can do to influence that?",
        "f87646615d4a351a4aef16e9": "They lost a lot of people, but they handled the Rogues for now. So there'll be mourning... and celebration. You get what I'm saying?",
        "046f12e733f76be697e7c89a": "Bring something to the table.",
        "3412d56a3e5846906f819270": "Exactly! Bring some supplies, it'll help. I don't have time to deal with that myself.",
        "901ce9b5e467a0480936add3": "Alright, I'll get what I can.",
        "400abf3af5a8809b46e0babd": "I'm not your grocery run. Ask someone else.",
        "1b27f7a686bcd3bf2f3fa007": "Don't forget the moonshine!",
        "4af2f451a3f0783914b8b5e5": "Brought some stuff. Is that enough?",
        "c2e020d8b3f3f392e12da082": "Let's see what you've got.",
        "bb22517a912ae59f4ead36f5": "Brought some sausage, thought it might help. (Hand over the sausage)",
        "d38bb3c6540eb72a18e1d045": "Been eating this crap my whole life, still don't trust what's in it. Alright, toss it here.",
        "e5f984c6725c393bf4868270": "Here are some crackers for snacks. (Hand over the croutons)",
        "d0ed247b38b92491ffb3195b": "Some snacks'll do! Give'em here...",
        "4c2cfe72d8690dc98019e480": "Found some moonshine. (Hand over the bottle of moonshine)",
        "d8ab5e718729cf02222241ff": "You got the Hatchling? Fuck yeah man, put it down carefully.",
        "62701f99681e0f87f8da2c43": "Got some vodka. (Hand over the bottle of vodka)",
        "dd40a658b3eab7f5d655664d": "Splendid!",
        "8a9105ccb8cab1f5f6181d66": "So is that enough?",
        "18f1bbf30296f08b96bc5a8f": "I'll come back with the rest.",
        "2a2f0e419718941062603e36": "Yeah, that'll do.",
        "3a430cf76e3022b87f86b4c5": "Guessing it'll take some time for the answer?",
        "cb2de2be793c74f89599d5c6": "Hell if I know. For now, keep using the hovercraft and handle your business on the ship. Come back later, we'll have a clear answer then.",
        "ae1e11f2a20a9d3a08f9b20c": "Got the lot. Moonshine included.",
        "913a4481850f52917aa3697b": "That's a decent haul of grub you brought. With stuff like this, the conversation will go a lot easier. By the next time we meet, I should have something for you about your request."
      }
    }
  }
]